; Chriz BG Playable Races: the engine code the hobgoblin's inventory hook (M_CBPRHI.lua) needs. Each
; pattern occurs once in the Baldur.exe of BG:EE and of BG2:EE 2.7.3.0 (EET runs the latter); the
; installer checks the game it installs into. Only call targets and RIP-relative offsets are left
; open (??), so a game whose classes have another layout does not match.
;
; The animation's paperdoll resref for a layer (vtable +0x48), the code monster_layered shares with
; ambient: out = "", and for layer 0 out = the INI's resref (the CString at +0xCD0).
